Suggests: bash-completion
Description: syntax-highlighting pager for git, diff and grep output
 Delta is a syntax-highlighting pager for git, diff, grep and blame output.
 It adds language syntax highlighting, within-line insertion and deletion
 detection, line numbers, side-by-side view and hyperlinks to the output of
 git diff, git show, git log -p, git blame and git grep.
 .
 The command is delta. Set it as git's pager (core.pager = delta,
 interactive.diffFilter = delta --color-only) to use it with git. Shell
 completions for bash, zsh and fish are included, and the themes.gitconfig
 helper is installed in /etc/delta, as in Debian's own package.
